{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265mnbvpUIsC1793617566.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，第四季租務市場保持活躍，元朗YOHO Midtown 新近錄得8座高層A室租賃成交，單位實用面積473平方呎，兩房間隔，月租1.92萬元租出，呎租40.6元。</p><p> </p><p>王勤學表示，租客為兩名空姐，鍾情YOHO Midtown為元朗區大型指標屋苑，生活配套完善且交通便利，有巴士直達機場，十分方便，故迅速租入上址。而業主於2020年以730萬元買入單位，租金回報約3.2厘。</p><p> </p><p>王勤學表示，YOHO Midtown本月錄得6宗租賃成交，平均實用呎租45.9元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:39.226674+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:18:36.189604+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:34.779700+00:00","content_hash":"b38892a6b788cfbd2d209c4475e4a7f3365c65b98960be5696f6246c68562a6a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}